{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cactus Simulator Remake is a game in which you can become a cactus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game will give you a meditative gameplay. You can stand and contemplate the beauty of the desert around you living your life as a cactus. You can also perform actions that cactus usually perform (stand in the same place).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New game engine</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved optimization</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved settings menu</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful stylized graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 game mods: arcade and realistic </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic change of day and night</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 localizations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Canonical Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a cactus </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're in the desert </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are other cacti around you </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And not only cacti</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3498560?t=1757850027","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3498560?t=1757850027","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498560/17b1ce2378d997ad439c188c876247c2fbfd8aed/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757850027","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498560/17b1ce2378d997ad439c188c876247c2fbfd8aed/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757850027","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"des